From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bumba <noreply@bumba>
Date: Mon, 24 Aug 2026 17:59:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] uucore: scope and cache embedded utility runtime context

Replace the one-localizer-per-thread model with utility-and-locale keyed bundles and scoped bindings. Own Fluent resources instead of leaking them, restore logical environment and umask on drop, and avoid leaking utility names. This lets embedders execute uutils inline without creating a disposable OS thread for every invocation.

---
